# Windows CI (actions/checkout on windows-latest) defaults to core.autocrlf=true
# and converts every text file to CRLF on checkout. Several tests and, more
# importantly, any future one that regex-matches a checked-out doc or skill file
# assuming bare \n will silently break only on Windows - which is exactly what
# happened here, undetected, until CI was checked directly. Force LF on checkout
# for every text format this repo actually has, so a Windows checkout is
# byte-for-byte the same as a Linux or macOS one and there is nothing left for a
# platform-specific line ending to break.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
